@startuml File Version Restore - Sequence Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor User
participant "VersionHistoryPanel" as UI
participant "CommandManager" as CM
participant "RestoreVersionCommand" as Cmd
participant "FileSystemService" as FSS
participant "MinIO\n(Versioning Enabled)" as MinIO
participant "VersionRetentionManager" as VRM
participant "RetentionStrategy" as Strategy

== View Version History ==

User -> UI: Click "Version History" button
activate UI

UI -> FSS: GET /api/projects/{id}/files/versions?path={filePath}
activate FSS

FSS -> MinIO: listObjects(bucket, path, {IncludeVersion: true})
activate MinIO
MinIO --> FSS: Stream of version objects
deactivate MinIO

FSS -> FSS: Transform to FileVersion[]
FSS --> UI: {success: true, versions: [...]}
deactivate FSS

UI -> UI: Display version timeline
UI --> User: Show versions with timestamps
deactivate UI

== Preview Specific Version ==

User -> UI: Click on version in timeline
activate UI

UI -> FSS: GET /api/projects/{id}/files/version/{versionId}?path={filePath}
activate FSS

FSS -> MinIO: getObject(bucket, path, {versionId})
activate MinIO
MinIO --> FSS: Stream of version content
deactivate MinIO

FSS -> FSS: Read stream to string
FSS --> UI: {success: true, content: "..."}
deactivate FSS

UI -> UI: Display content in preview pane
UI --> User: Show version content
deactivate UI

== Restore Version (Command Pattern) ==

User -> UI: Click "Restore" button
activate UI

UI -> UI: Confirm restore action
UI -> User: "Are you sure?"
User --> UI: Confirm

UI -> Cmd: new RestoreVersionCommand(userId, projectId, filePath, versionId, versionService)
activate Cmd
Cmd -> Cmd: Store parameters
UI -> CM: execute(restoreCommand)
deactivate UI
activate CM

CM -> Cmd: execute()
note right: **Template Method Pattern**\nBaseCommand.execute() orchestrates

== Command Execution (Template Method) ==

Cmd -> Cmd: Check if already executed
Cmd -> Cmd: doExecute() <<hook method>>
activate Cmd

Cmd -> FSS: getCurrentFileContent(projectId, filePath)
activate FSS
FSS -> MinIO: getObject(bucket, currentPath)
activate MinIO
MinIO --> FSS: Current content stream
deactivate MinIO
FSS --> Cmd: {success: true, content: "current..."}
deactivate FSS

Cmd -> Cmd: this.previousContent = "current..."
note right: **Memento Pattern**\nSave current state\nfor undo capability

Cmd -> FSS: getFileVersion(projectId, filePath, versionId)
activate FSS
FSS -> MinIO: getObject(bucket, path, {versionId})
activate MinIO
MinIO --> FSS: Old version content
deactivate MinIO
FSS --> Cmd: {success: true, content: "old..."}
deactivate FSS

Cmd -> Cmd: this.restoredContent = "old..."

Cmd -> FSS: restoreFileVersion(projectId, filePath, versionId)
activate FSS

FSS -> FSS: Get version content
FSS -> MinIO: putObject(bucket, path, oldContent, metadata)
activate MinIO
note right: MinIO creates NEW version\nwith old content\n(Versioning is automatic)
MinIO -> MinIO: Generate new versionId
MinIO --> FSS: Success, new versionId
deactivate MinIO

FSS --> Cmd: {success: true, message: "Restored"}
deactivate FSS

Cmd -> Cmd: this.executed = true
Cmd -> Cmd: onContentUpdate(restoredContent)
deactivate Cmd

Cmd --> CM: Command executed successfully
CM -> CM: Push to command stack
CM --> UI: Execution complete
deactivate CM
activate UI

UI -> UI: Refresh file content
UI -> User: "File restored successfully!"
deactivate UI

== Undo Restore (Command Pattern) ==

User -> UI: Press Ctrl+Z (Undo)
activate UI

UI -> CM: undo()
activate CM

CM -> CM: Pop from command stack
CM -> Cmd: undo()
activate Cmd

Cmd -> Cmd: Check canUndo()
Cmd -> Cmd: doUndo() <<hook method>>
Cmd -> Cmd: Restore this.previousContent
Cmd -> FSS: restoreFileVersion(..., previousVersionId)
activate FSS
FSS -> MinIO: putObject(bucket, path, previousContent)
activate MinIO
MinIO --> FSS: Success
deactivate MinIO
FSS --> Cmd: Restored
deactivate FSS

Cmd -> Cmd: this.executed = false
Cmd -> Cmd: onContentUpdate(previousContent)
Cmd --> CM: Undo complete
deactivate Cmd

CM -> CM: Push to redo stack
CM --> UI: Undo successful
deactivate CM

UI -> User: "Restore undone"
deactivate UI

== Apply Retention Policy (Strategy Pattern) ==

activate VRM
note right: **Strategy Pattern**\nScheduled task or manual trigger

VRM -> FSS: listFileVersions(projectId, filePath)
activate FSS
FSS -> MinIO: listObjects(bucket, path, {IncludeVersion: true})
activate MinIO
MinIO --> FSS: All versions
deactivate MinIO
FSS --> VRM: versions[]
deactivate FSS

VRM -> Strategy: filterVersionsToKeep(versions)
activate Strategy
note right: Strategy decides which\nversions to keep based\non configured policy

Strategy -> Strategy: Apply retention logic\n(e.g., keep last 10 versions)
Strategy --> VRM: versionsToKeep[]
deactivate Strategy

VRM -> VRM: versionsToDelete = all - toKeep

loop For each version to delete
    VRM -> FSS: deleteFileVersion(projectId, filePath, versionId)
    activate FSS
    FSS -> MinIO: removeObject(bucket, path, {versionId})
    activate MinIO
    MinIO --> FSS: Deleted
    deactivate MinIO
    FSS --> VRM: Success
    deactivate FSS
end

VRM -> VRM: Log cleanup summary
deactivate VRM

note over MinIO
  **MinIO Built-in Versioning**
  - Automatic version ID generation
  - Immutable version storage
  - Delete markers for recovery
  - S3-compatible API
end note

@enduml
